UPDATE companies SET description='Velocity Metalworks operates from two Illinois locations, with its headquarters in Hoffman and a second facility in Belleville. The company was founded in 1970 and has spent over five decades building a reputation in tool & die, metal stamping, fabrication, and contract manufacturing. Ownership details and founder names are not publicly disclosed.

