UPDATE companies SET description='VEXOS is headquartered in King of Prussia, Pennsylvania. It operates as part of the East West family following an acquisition announced on its website.

The company provides electronics manufacturing services (EMS) and custom material solutions (CMS) for original equipment manufacturers. Its capabilities span printed circuit board assembly, box build, cable and harness assembly, precision metal fabrication (stamping, die-casting, extrusions), molded parts assembly, and advanced engineering services such as design for manufacturing, design for assembly, and value engineering. VEXOS operates a global footprint with facilities in the United States, Canada, Mexico, Vietnam, and China, supporting high-mix, high-complexity, mid-to-low-volume production. Specific facility sizes, headcount, or annual volumes are not disclosed.

VEXOS serves OEMs across communications, industrial equipment, medical, computing, automotive, aerospace and defense, lighting, display technology, appliance, HVAC, health and fitness equipment, and consumer electronics markets. The company highlights work with medical OEMs delivering clinical to patient-side technologies, automotive suppliers, and aerospace and defense customers requiring mission-critical solutions.

VEXOS emphasizes a “Local Service. Global Capabilities.” model, combining a customer-centric culture of responsiveness and flexibility with a hybrid manufacturing approach that leverages the strengths of each global site. Differentiators cited include single-source accountability for complementary products and services, domestic warehousing in North America, dedicated RoHS and non-RoHS production lines, and ITAR registration at its Vancouver, Washington facility.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001:2015','ISO 13485:2016','AS9100D','FDA Registered','ITAR Registered','TL9000','ISO 14001:2015','IATF 16949:2016','ISO 45001:2018','ISO 50001','RoHS processes','Controlled Goods Program registered facility','Certified IPC-A-610 Specialists (CIS)','Certified IPC Trainers (CIT)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB assembly (PCBA)", "Box build assembly", "Cable and harness assembly", "Precision metal fabrication (stamping, die-casting, extrusions)", "Molded parts assembly", "Advanced engineering services (DFX)", "Design for manufacturing (DFM)", "Design for assembly (DFA)", "Design for fabrication (DFF)", "Value engineering", "New product introduction (NPI)", "Supply chain management", "Global manufacturing footprint (USA, Canada, Mexico, Vietnam, China)", "RoHS and non-RoHS production", "Temperature and humidity controlled production", "Test plan development for PCBA", "Direct order fulfillment", "Reverse logistics (RMA, repair depot)", "PCB fabrication design", "Integration services", "Custom material solutions"], "industries": ["Communications", "Industrial Equipment", "Medical", "Computing", "Automotive", "Aerospace & Defense", "Lighting", "Display Technology", "Appliance", "HVAC", "Health and Fitness Equipment", "Consumer Electronics"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "High-mix, high-complexity, mid to low-volume", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Local Service. Global Capabilities.", "High-mix, high-complexity, mid to low-volume EMS", "Global manufacturing footprint across USA, Canada, Mexico, Vietnam, China", "Advanced engineering (DFX) engaging early in design cycle", "Custom material solutions for electro-mechanical, metal fabrication, molded parts, cable & harness"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in King of Prussia, Pennsylvania -> db", "Part of East West family -> /", "EMS and custom material solutions provider -> /about", "Capabilities: PCBA, box build, cable/harness, metal fabrication, molded parts, DFX, NPI, supply chain -> /services, /about", "Global facilities in USA, Canada, Mexico, Vietnam, China -> /, /about, /services", "Industries served: communications, industrial, medical, computing, automotive, aerospace & defense, lighting, display, appliance, HVAC, health/fitness, consumer electronics -> /, /services", "Certifications: ISO 9001:2015, ISO 13485:2016, AS9100D, FDA, ITAR, TL9000, ISO 14001, IATF 16949, ISO 45001, ISO 50001, RoHS, Controlled Goods Program, IPC-A-610, IPC trainers -> /quality", "Languages: English, German, Vietnamese, Chinese, French, Spanish -> /", "LinkedIn URL -> db", "Volume: high-mix, high-complexity, mid to low-volume -> /about, /services", "Differentiators: Local Service Global Capabilities, hybrid manufacturing, single-source accountability, domestic warehousing, dedicated RoHS lines -> /about, /services"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "VEXOS is a full-service provider of high-mix, high-complexity, mid to low-volume electronics manufacturing and custom material solutions.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": ["ITAR registered", "Controlled Goods Program registered"], "languages": ["English", "Deutsch", "Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t", "\u4e2d\u6587 (\u7b80\u4f53)", "Fran\u00e7ais", "Espa\u00f1ol"], "social_links": ["https://www.linkedin.com/company/vexos/"], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='vexos-headquarters' AND approv