UPDATE companies SET description='VieMed Healthcare is headquartered in Lafayette, Louisiana, and was founded in 2006 by Casey Hoyt and Michael Moore. The company began on a foundation of friendship, loyalty, and a commitment to treating others right, ideals that continue to shape its culture as it expands across the United States.

The company delivers a range of in-home clinical services centered on respiratory care and disease management. Its licensed respiratory therapists provide 24/7 personalized care for conditions such as chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, neuromuscular diseases, and obstructive sleep apnea, using remote monitoring technologies and proprietary connected health platforms. VieMed also operates VieMed Healthcare Staffing (VHS), a Joint Commission–certified division that places clinical professionals in facilities and homes nationwide. Through its PACE program, the organization focuses on reducing exacerbations, readmissions, and emergency visits via one-on-one patient assessments. As a publicly traded entity listed on the Toronto Stock Exchange and NASDAQ (VMD), VieMed operates a national family of brands serving thousands of patients.

VieMed serves patients directly — from infancy through end of life — as well as healthcare organizations, providers, and payers seeking staffing solutions or disease management partnerships. Its clinical teams include respiratory therapists, licensed clinical social workers, and healthcare administrators who coordinate care across the continuum.

The company distinguishes itself through a high-tech, high-touch model that combines proprietary remote monitoring with in-person clinician visits. Its comprehensive disease management approach aims to lower hospitalization rates, improve patient satisfaction, and reduce overall costs, while its staffing division holds Joint Commission accreditation as a mark of quality.', certifications=ARRAY['Joint Commission (healthcare staffing)']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Home respiratory care", "Disease management (COPD, neuromuscular diseases, sleep apnea)", "Remote patient monitoring", "Connected health technology", "In-home sleep testing", "Behavioral health counseling", "Healthcare staffing (VHS)", "Clinical social work", "Patient education and therapy", "PACE program for exacerbation reduction"], "industries": ["Home healthcare", "Respiratory care", "Disease management", "Healthcare staffing", "Telehealth / remote monitoring", "Sleep medicine", "Behavioral health"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["24/7 licensed respiratory therapists with remote monitoring", "Proprietary connected health technology platform", "Joint Commission certified healthcare staffing (VHS)", "PACE in-home respiratory care program targeting readmission reduction", "High-tech, high-touch disease management model"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2006 by Casey Hoyt and Michael Moore -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Lafayette, Louisiana -> db", "Publicly traded on TSX and NASDAQ (VMD) -> /about-us", "Services: home respiratory care, disease management, staffing, connected health, sleep health, behavioral health, PACE program -> /, /about-us", "Joint Commission certification for VHS staffing -> /", "24/7 licensed respiratory therapists -> /", "Proprietary connected health technologies for remote monitoring -> /", "In-home sleep testing -> /", "VieMed Clinical Care for behavioral health -> /", "Core values: Respect, Integrity, Perseverance, Excellence, Competitiveness -> /about-us", "Mission and vision statements -> /about-us", "Brand family serving thousands of patients nationwide -> /about-us", "Patient testimonials from multiple states -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "VieMed makes home respiratory care simple, effective, and stress-free with innovative treatment plans and dedicated specialists on call 24/7.", "founded_year": "2006", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='viemed-healthcare' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
