UPDATE companies SET description='VirTechnology Contract Manufacturing operates from Windsor, Vermont, as a start-up contract manufacturer focused on printed circuit board assembly and box-build services. The company was founded to provide turnkey manufacturing solutions for clients across medical, military, aerospace, and weapons sectors, though a specific founding year and founder names are not publicly disclosed.

