UPDATE companies SET description='Virginia Vinegar Works was founded in 2008 in Shipman, Virginia. The company began with humble production of wine vinegar in porcelain crocks and has since expanded to using stainless steel tanks for fermentation and older wine barrels for ageing.

The company produces artisanal vinegars using the traditional Orleans method, a slow conversion process that retains the character of the base wine. Its lineup includes barrel-aged wine vinegars (both blended and single-varietal), seasonal fruit vinegars made with fresh local fruit, and robust malt vinegars sourced from nearby craft breweries.

Virginia Vinegar Works serves professional chefs, restaurants, gourmet food outlets, and home cooks seeking exceptional flavor. Its products are marketed for both culinary professionals and retail consumers, with an emphasis on local ingredients from Virginia vineyards and farms.

