UPDATE companies SET description='Watson Metals Co. operates from State Road, North Carolina, in Surry County. The company traces its roots to 1988, when it began as a locally owned and operated shop serving friends and neighbors in the surrounding area.

The shop provides metal fabrication and welding services, including sheet metal work, custom metal projects, and on-site welding. It also rents cranes, boom trucks, hoists, and other heavy equipment. The facility sits just off Highway 77, with enough floor space for custom fabrication and on-site sheet metal storage.

Customers range from homeowners needing benches, ladders, or custom railings to commercial contractors requiring rebar cages for elevator shafts and construction firms moving heavy loads. The company serves both residential and commercial clients across Surry County, Wilkes County, and the broader Foothills region.

