UPDATE companies SET description='Welding Shop & MFG, LLC operates from Cheyenne, Wyoming, where it began in 1975 as The Welding Shop under founders Gerald (Jerry) and JoAnn Pauli. The business remains family-owned and is now run by their sons, Gary and Dwayne Pauli. In 2011 the company adopted its current name, Welding Shop & MFG, LLC, while continuing to serve the surrounding region from its location at 508 East 1st Street.

The shop provides welding, custom fabrication, and machine work, including aluminum welding, drive-shaft repair, ornamental metalwork, handrails, and safety window guards. Since 2000 it has manufactured its own line of Paulibuilt trailers — ranging from utility and sports models to commercial haulers — and offers a full trailer parts department opened in 2012.

The company has performed work for the railroad industry, as noted in customer feedback, and serves both commercial and private clients needing trailer repair, preventive maintenance, hydraulic fitting repair, and custom-built trailers.

