UPDATE companies SET description='Western Medical Equipment was founded in 2008 in Jackson, Wyoming. The company operates as a limited liability company serving the Jackson Hole region.

The business rents and sells a broad range of home medical equipment. Its inventory includes mobility devices such as power scooters, electric and manual wheelchairs, knee walkers, rollators, and walkers; respiratory products including tanked oxygen, home and portable oxygen concentrators, and CPAP machines; post-operative cooling and compression systems like the Game Ready unit; maternity items such as Medela hospital-grade breast pumps and accessories; plus hospital beds, patient lifts, lift chairs, bath safety equipment, wound care supplies, and a curated selection of hemp-derived CBD products. The company also provides in-house billing assistance to help customers navigate insurance reimbursement.

Western Medical Equipment primarily serves individuals recovering from injury or surgery, patients with chronic respiratory conditions, and new or expecting mothers. Its customer base includes private-pay clients and those using insurance, with a focus on the Jackson, Wyoming area and surrounding communities. The company’s product lines address home healthcare, durable medical equipment rental and retail, respiratory therapy, maternity care, and the growing CBD wellness market.

The company states that its founding mission was to make essential home medical supplies affordable and accessible. It differentiates itself by offering insurance billing support, a selective line of premium CBD products at discounted prices, and the Game Ready system for rest, ice, compression, and elevation therapy. These services aim to reduce the financial and logistical burden on patients during recovery.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Medical equipment rental", "Medical equipment sales", "Insurance billing assistance", "Oxygen therapy equipment provision", "Cold compression therapy (Game Ready)", "Breast pump sales and fitting", "CBD product retail", "Home healthcare product consultation"], "industries": ["Home healthcare", "Durable medical equipment rental", "Durable medical equipment retail", "Respiratory therapy", "Maternity care", "Hemp/CBD retail"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Game Ready cold compression therapy system", "Medela breast pumps"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house insurance billing assistance", "Rental and sales of mobility, respiratory, and post-operative equipment", "Game Ready cold compression therapy systems", "Medela hospital-grade breast pumps and accessories", "Curated high-quality CBD products at discounted prices"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2008 -> /about", "Located in Jackson, Wyoming -> /about", "Rents and sells mobility equipment -> /about", "Offers Game Ready cold compression devices -> /about", "Provides in-house billing for insurance reimbursements -> /about", "Offers Medela breast pumps -> /about", "Sells CBD products -> /about", "Provides oxygen therapy equipment -> /about", "Offers hospital beds, patient lifts, lift chairs, bath safety, wound care, lymphedema treatment -> /about", "Hours of operation Monday-Friday 9am-5pm -> /"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "WME rents and sells mobility products including powe