UPDATE companies SET description='Westfall Technik, LLC is an integrated plastics manufacturer headquartered in Tempe, Arizona. The company does not disclose its founding year or ownership structure, and no founders are named in public materials. It operates under a "Stacked Integration Model™" that combines design, tooling, molding, assembly, and automation within a single platform.

The company provides end-to-end plastics manufacturing, including micro injection molding, precision tooling design and build, MHS Hot Runner systems, automation cell engineering, assembly and kitting (nitrogen-purged foil pouches, Tyvek-sealed trays, vapor-proof bags), prototyping, and high-volume production. Production volumes range from prototype and medium lots to high-volume runs.

Westfall serves healthcare and medical device OEMs, offering ISO-certified cleanrooms, validated assembly, and micro molding for medical components. It also supports consumer packaged goods brands with high-speed, tight-tolerance molding, automation, and sustainable material strategies for performance and recyclability.

The company differentiates itself through its Stacked Integration Model™, which eliminates supply-chain handoffs to accelerate speed-to-market and reduce scrap. It claims 100% defect-free parts backed by metrology labs staffed 16+ hours daily, and proprietary technology such as the DynaClass Tooling and Molding System and MHS Hot Runner systems that it says "skipped a generation" in micro-injection molding.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Design for Manufacturability (DFM)", "Design for Moldability", "Micro Injection Molding", "Precision Injection Molding", "Tooling Design and Build", "MHS Hot Runner Systems", "Automation Cell Engineering", "Assembly and Kitting (nitrogen-purged foil pouches, Tyvek-sealed trays, vapor-proof bags)", "Prototyping (low-volume, bridge tooling, pre-production)", "High-Volume Production", "Medium/Small Lot Production", "Quality Assurance (metrology, inspection)", "Cleanroom Manufacturing (ISO-certified)", "Sustainable Material Strategies", "Logistics and Customized System Solutions", "DynaClass Tooling and Molding System", "Proprietary Micro Molding Technology", "Global Manufacturing Footprint"], "industries": ["Healthcare", "Medical Device", "Consumer Packaged Goods"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["MHS Hot Runner Systems", "Automated Injection Molding Machines (312+)", "Metrology Lab Equipment"], "volume": "Prototype to high-volume production; medium to small lots", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Tempe, Arizona -> db and page ''/''", "Stacked Integration Model combining design, tooling, molding, assembly, automation -> page ''/''", "Serves healthcare/medical device and consumer packaged goods industries -> page ''/''", "2025+ qualified associates, 312+ automated machines, 1M+ sq ft manufacturing space, 18+ worldwide locations -> page ''/''", "Micro injection molding, precision tooling, MHS Hot Runner systems, automation cell engineering -> page ''/''", "A