UPDATE companies SET description='Whitehurst Custom Woodworking operates from Raleigh, North Carolina. The business was founded by Jeremy, who grew up in Tarboro, NC, watching his father work with metal. After purchasing his first home in college, he began building small pieces and eventually turned his woodworking passion into a full-time career after more than a decade and two other careers.

The shop produces handcrafted, heirloom-quality furniture with an emphasis on timeless design, function, natural materials, and traditional joinery techniques. Its core offerings include custom furniture pieces and end-grain butcher blocks. The company serves the Raleigh, Durham, and Chapel Hill areas, though it ships beyond the region.

Jeremy states his mission is to preserve the craft of fine furniture making by offering the community furniture built with exceptional craftsmanship rooted in tradition while embracing innovation. The company''s tagline, “How it’s made matters,” underscores its commitment to process and material integrity.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["End Grain Butcher Blocks", "Furniture Making"], "industries": ["Residential Furniture", "Custom Woodworking", "Home Furnishings"], "materials": ["Cherry wood", "Natural wood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handcrafted heirloom-quality furniture", "Timeless designs with focus on function", "Natural materials and proper joinery techniques", "Serving Raleigh, Durham, Chapel Hill and beyond", "Mission to preserve fine furniture craftsmanship"], "facts_used": ["Location: Raleigh, NC -> db", "Founder Jeremy, background in Tarboro, NC -> /about", "Mission statement -> /about", "Capabilities: End Grain Butcher Blocks, Furniture Making -> db", "Service area: Raleigh, Durham, Chapel Hill -> /", "Testimonial mentions cherry wood table -> /", "Handcrafted heirloom quality furniture -> /", "Emphasis on natural materials and proper joinery -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Whitehurst Custom Woodworking specializes in handcrafted, heirloom quality furniture.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='whitehurst-custom-woodworking' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Wicker Brothers Inc operates a custom metal fabrication shop in Florence, Mississippi. The company serves clients across the region with a full range of fabrication services from design through installation.

The shop provides design and prototyping, welding (TIG, MIG, and laser), field repairs and installation, and both small- and large-scale manufacturing. Its equipment includes multiple press brakes (up to 200-ton), hydraulic shears, ironworkers, horizontal bandsaws, plate rolls, a pipe bender, angle and tube rolls, a spot welder, belt sanders, a Timesaver wide belt sander, CNC cutting (Amada 3 kW fiber laser, Messer high-definition plasma, Calypso waterjet), three lathes, three mills, a 10'' x 10'' x 25'' powder coating oven, and industrial sandblasting pots. The company also deploys 15 fully equipped service trucks for on-site work.

Wicker Brothers serves hospitals, restaurants, and shipping companies, among other industries. Its medical and hospital clients rely on the shop for custom metal components and installations, while restaurant and shipping customers use its fabrication and repair capabilities.

